%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI see... so you are Yoshimura...\d%K%P
「原来，你就是芳村吗…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI have been working under Milady... or rather, Managing\nDirector Sawashima for quite some time now.\d%K%P
「大小姐…不，泽嶋董事的照顾，\n平时多有领受了」%K%P
Incredible...%K%P
真厉害啊…%K%P
I could feel this man's enormous presence even through the\nphone receiver.%K%P
这个人声音中包含着压倒性的威严，\n强度不亚于电波干扰。%K%P
Before making the call, I was confident I could bluff my\nway through this. Now, though... I felt like apologizing\nprofusely.%K%P
对我来说，虽然已经拼命地虚张声势了，\n但他仅仅用两三句话就表明了立场，\n让我都快要说着『抱歉抱歉』不住地颤抖着了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dO-Osamu... what is the meaning of this?\d%K%P
「理、理先生…这，是什么意思？」%K%P
But I couldn't back down now.%K%P
可是，我不能颤抖。%K%P
Because here in my arms was a person who meant the world\nto me -- a girl who was, and would be, my lover.%K%P
如今，我怀抱的，\n是那么信赖我、仰仗我，小鸟依人般的，\n我最重要的恋人…对，我的恋人就在身边。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIt's okay. Don't worry.\nLeave everything to me.\d%K%P
「没关系、没关系的。\n交给我吧」%K%P
I couldn't let her worry.\nI couldn't let her notice my fear.%K%P
我不能让她也感到不安。\n不能让她感到我在颤抖。%K%P
I also had to be ready to console her, as the truth that\nwould come to light in a moment would hurt her immensely.%K%P
若是之后的真相深深地伤害了她的话，\n我也必须将她的身心治愈。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhy...? How is Kagoshima Junichirou my father?\d%K%P
「为什么…？\n为什么，神子岛顺一郎是我的父亲？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dKagoshima Junichirou is... a pen name for Sawashima\nJunpei.\d%K%P
「神子岛顺一郎这个名字，是泽嶋顺平先生的…\n是令尊过去的笔名啊」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...A pen name?\d%K%P
「…笔名？」%K%P
But she had to know the truth.%K%P
可是，我必须把真相告诉她。%K%P
To win this battle, she had to rebel against her own\nfather.%K%P
因为，为了赢得这场对决，\n她，不得不与父亲站到对立面上。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHow did you find out so much? I have only used that name\nthree times in my entire life.\d%K%P
「你终于发现了啊。\n我的人生中至今为止，只用过这个名字三次」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dIn one of your interviews, I believe you mentioned that\nthere was a time you wished to become a writer.\d%K%P
「以前，您在接受经济杂志的采访时，\n回答过『想要成为小说家』吧？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dDid I?\d%K%P
「哦，那又怎样？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhen I remembered that, it all came to me... two\nparticular fragments of your name overlap with Kagoshima\nJunichirou.\d%K%P
「想起这个的时候，我才恍然大悟…\n『神子岛顺一郎』，其中包含了您本名的两个字」%K%P
\dShima\d and \dJun\d.%K%P
『岛』和『顺』。%K%P
It wasn't rare for writers to base their pen names on\ntheir actual names.%K%P
把自己的本名的一部分，\n放进笔名里的作家并不少见。%K%P
Or rather, the strange similarity to the name of a person\nso close to us was highly suspicious by itself.%K%P
也就是说，与此关系颇深的人物，\n若是符合两个字这一条件，悬案就水落石出了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI won't bore you with the details, but after doing some\nextensive research on the internet, I happened upon\nsomething quite interesting.\d%K%P
「之后，我用尽了各种手段在网络上检索，\n只找到了１样…」%K%P
With help from my phone, the national library, and my own\ntwo feet, I finally found a thirty-year-old literary\nmagazine.%K%P
接下来，我打了电话，又跑到国会图书馆，\n终于找到了３０多年前的，某本文艺杂志。%K%P
Kagoshima Junichirou won the consolation prize for a\nbiography about a man who, despite accruing enormous\nwealth, ended up losing everything in but a few years.%K%P
神子岛顺一郎，得到了审查员奖励奖。\n描写了一个男人在战后的复兴期，靠经营地产成为了百万富翁，\n但又在数年之间，失去了这一切的半生沉浮。%K%P
It made me wonder what Japan's real estate business would\nlook like right now had he won first prize at the time.%K%P
如果，那时他得到了大奖，\n如今地产界的势力图，又会是怎样一副图景呢…%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dOh? I tried looking for that myself, but never found\nanything.\d%K%P
「哦？不过我也在网络上检索过，\n可却什么都没有找到」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThe information is accurate -- my -super hacker- friend\nspent a whole night validating its legitimacy.\d%K%P
「您在这一点上也没有疏忽啊。\n我朋友是个超级黑客，是他花了一晚上帮我找到的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu... Are you sure people really say that?\d%K%P
「理先生，好像发音哪里不对？」%K%P
I wasn't sure myself, but that was what Mr. Kumazaki had\ncalled himself, so...%K%P
虽然我也是这么想的，不过熊崎先生是这么自称的…%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI see. Your intuition and tenacity is admirable.\nThe praise Sasaki heaped on you seems to be well-placed.\d%K%P
「原来如此，思维和韧性都很不错。\n我有点儿明白为什么佐佐木经常夸奖你了」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...You ordered Mr. Sasaki to disappear, did you not?\d%K%P
「…佐佐木先生不在了，\n也是你的命令吧？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
That last phone call from Mr. Sasaki was likely the final\nwarning he could give me without being found out.%K%P
那时，大概是佐佐木先生在电话中，\n躲过监视的耳目，拼死地警告了我吧。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou took all the credit cards and cash from Himeo, and\neven froze her bank account. All to prevent her from\ninterfering with you.\d%K%P
「于是，你从姫绪小姐的信用卡里取出了现金，\n然后冻结账户。\n…假借他人之手，自己却置身之外」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dD-Dad...? What is this supposed to mean?\d%K%P
「父、父亲…？\n这到底，是怎么一回事儿？」%K%P
Her electricity was turned off because they could no\nlonger automatically charge her bank account. Right now,\nHimeo had as much monetary power as a barefoot beggar on\nthe street.%K%P
电力停止了供应，是因为账户的余额根本不够。\n如今的姬绪小姐，在这里仿佛净身出户一般。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy...? I can understand what you're doing, but I simply\ncannot comprehend what you're thinking.\d%K%P
「为什么…\n我，虽然知道您在做什么，\n但还是完全不明白您在想什么」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dOh? Was that too difficult to figure out, even for a\ndetective of your caliber?\d%K%P
「喔…果然名侦探也束手无策了吗？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou spent a few years in that house yourself.\nDon't you also view it as a nostalgic place filled with\nold memories?\d%K%P
「这个家，是你呆了好几年，\n充满无数回忆的地方吧？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dAnd your point is...?\d%K%P
「然后呢…？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy did you give it away alongside that bond?\d%K%P
「…为什么就这么放弃了？\n和那个借据一起」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姬緒
\dEh...?\d%K%P
「诶…？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI see... So you've figured that out as well.\d%K%P
「哦…你连那个都知道了啊」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
After some research, I happened upon a few interesting\ndetails about Nishikawa Jousai Building's East Hagimori\nApartment Complex Project.%K%P
我用了各式各样的手段，\n对城西建物股份有限公司的东萩守公寓建造计划进行了调查。%K%P
Ten stories high and boasting thirty-six apartments, each\nworth at least fifty million yen, with the top floor\nsuites exceeding two hundred million.%K%P
地上建１０层。一共３６户人家。\n分开出售的价格是５０００万起，最上面一层超过２亿。%K%P
The very scale of such a building made it very clear that\nthe land from the Terrace House Hinosaka would not be\nenough to build it.%K%P
考虑到建筑面积，如同姫绪小姐以前指出过的，\n就凭Terrace House阳之坂的土地大小，是建造不了的。%K%P
But if you added the large Sawashima mansion next door...%K%P
不过…\n如果加上这个泽嶋家别宅所占的广大土地…%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dAll those years ago, you loaned that money to Ms. Honoka\nout of the kindness of your heart. That much is correct,\nisn't it?\d%K%P
「几年前，你确实抱持着纯粹的善意，\n把钱借给了穗香小姐吧？」%K%P
No one in their right mind would loan out such a sum on a\nhand-written bond if they wanted to get it back.%K%P
不是那样的话，就凭那样的一纸借据，\n是不可能借到１００万的。%K%P
Not to mention, it wasn't even using his real name -- I\nwondered how that would go in court.%K%P
毕竟，就算被赖账，也不会有任何怨言，\n因为那是一张连本名都没有记载的无根无凭借据。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou were looking after Mitoko after her birth, weren't\nyou?\d%K%P
「您非常喜爱刚出生的美都子吧？」%K%P
I could tell from the way he smiled in that photo.%K%P
从那张相片上勉强的笑容来看，这事也很清楚了。%K%P
East Hagimori -- or rather, the mansion and the house next\ndoor -- must've held a special place in his heart.%K%P
毫无疑问，对东萩守…\n不，他对这个家和临近的公寓，\n有着千丝万缕的回忆。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhy...? Why are you trying to tarnish your memories?\d%K%P
「为什么…\n要自己把自己的回忆全部抹去啊？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dIt's business.\d%K%P
「生意就是生意啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dWhat...?!\d%K%P
「什…！？」%K%P
Over the past year, I came to the belief that I had been\nmisunderstanding Sawashima Junpei up until now, but...%K%P
我看来一直误解了泽嶋顺平这个人物。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dThere are some who would say that a major building\nproject in a luxurious residential area such as East\nHagimori is ridiculous.\d%K%P
「对于有着高级住宅区的东萩守来说，\n进行大规模的都市开发是不可能的。\n…这些论调，很多人都提出过」%K%P
In the public eye, he was known as a man to whom the end\njustified the means. Someone who would get his way swiftly\nand without mercy.%K%P
为了达到目的，不择手段，\n迅速、大规模、冷静地解决一切。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHowever, from my point of view, that land looks like a\ntreasure chest left unopened.\d%K%P
「可是，要我说，那块地简直就是金山银山」%K%P
If something could be settled with money, he would take\ncare of it before anyone could even notice. And he would\nnever leave a trace, regardless of whether he was involved\nin bribery or extortion.%K%P
能用钱解决的问题，就能『全部解决』。\n使用的场合，与榨取的场合，也没有明确的平衡界限。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dIn truth, I'm not the only one to notice the potential\nprofits inherent in such a venture... but to achieve it,\nyou have to buy out the entire town. And others lack the\nfunds to do so.\d%K%P
「实际上，『出手就会赚钱』这一点谁都清楚。\n只是，为了赚钱，必须要买下整条街的土地。\n别的家伙没有这个资金，仅此而已」%K%P
I thought those were no more than baseless rumors started\nby people unsettled by the swift growth of the Sawashima\nGroup...%K%P
难怪人们对泽嶋集团的急剧扩张，会觉得反感与不安，\n以至于到了诽谤中伤的地步。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dThe current apartment complex plan is but a snippet of\nthe full picture -- a mere first step. In ten years, the\nentirety of East Hagimori will belong to the Sawashima\nGroup.\d%K%P
「这次的公寓建设，只不过是迈出了一小步。\n反正东萩守这个地方，１０年之后一定会在泽嶋的名下」%K%P
...because I knew his daughter and the kind of person she\nwas.%K%P
…我是了解他的独生女的。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dDo you understand, Yoshimura? If you wish to be a member\nof our group, you will have to be able to make such simple\ncalculations yourself.\d%K%P
「懂了吗，芳村？\n你若是泽嶋集团的一员，\n这种程度也能算得到吧」%K%P
A gentle girl who tried to mask her naivete with a poorly-\nimitated villainous exterior. That was the Sawashima Himeo\nI knew.%K%P
外冷内热，善良，有些脱线，非常可爱，\n我遇到的正是这样的泽嶋姫绪。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dAnd forget the idea of attaining a desirable position\nthrough my daughter. If you want power, you'll have to\nrise through the ranks by your own merits.\d%K%P
「想得到我女儿，然后飞黄腾达？抛弃这类没骨气的想法吧。\n我最厌恶你这种人了。小子，凭借实力往上爬吧」%K%P
But could it be that in the end, it was all a\n-misunderstanding- on my part to think I might have\n-misunderstood- him before?%K%P
可是，难道说…\n一直以来我以为是自己误解了的事，\n本来就是误解吗？%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dAs such, you can tell Himeo that the house she is\ncurrently using will be demolished by the end of the year,\nand that she should move back home before that happens.\d%K%P
「就是这样了，所以转告姬绪吧。\n那个房子，今年就要让房地产商拆掉了。\n在那之前，给我快回老家去」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dNg?! D-Dad!\d%K%P
「啊！？\n爸、爸爸！」%K%P
Himeo, who had been dazed by the sheer abruptness of all\nthese developments, suddenly came back to her senses and\nsnatched the phone receiver out of my hands.%K%P
姫绪小姐一时目瞪口呆，\n过了半晌，她回过神来，抢走了我手中的手机，\n惊慌地叫着她的父亲。%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dHimeo? You... were there...?\d%K%P
「姫绪？\n你真的在那里…在芳村身边吗？」%K%P
Junpei himself sounded slightly taken aback.%K%P
另一边的顺平先生，听到姫绪小姐突然的插嘴，\n用比刚才更加不开心的声音回应道。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWh-Why are you doing this? Why would you think of\nbullying Toko of all people? A good girl like her...\d%K%P
「为…为什么要那么做啊？\n为什么爸爸要让小都子吃苦受罪啊？\n那么好的女孩子…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dYou were with him this whole time?\d%K%P
「你一直，和那个男人在一起吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAnswer me! This is crazy!\d%K%P
「告诉我！\n您真是太过分了！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI'm the one asking the questions!\d%K%P
「你先给我老实交代问题」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDad!\d%K%P
「爸爸！」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...Well, fine. I imagine you've heard all I said, then?\nCome back home by the end of the month.\d%K%P
「…好吧，你够了。\n那刚才你听到我的话了吧？\n这个月就回来」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat... What are you saying?\nI can't do that -- that's ridiculous.\d%K%P
「什么…您在说什么啊？\n那肯定是不可能的啊」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI can transfer you to a local university.\nYou can pick whichever you want.\d%K%P
「大学也转到这边来好了。\n选一个你喜欢的学校，把手续办了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI am an employee at Michihama Trading right now!\nBecause you told me to!\d%K%P
「我现在是道浜商事的人！\n爸爸就这么对我说话吗！？」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dWas it not a splendid opportunity to learn? I take it\nyou've realized that one cannot run a business on kindness\nalone. If so, then you no longer need to waste any more of\nyour time there.\d%K%P
「你多少学到一些了吧？\n只凭一腔热血的奉献精神，是无法在社会上生存的吧？\n你要是明白，就没必要待在那里了」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI've heard of your various exploits overseas, and the way\nyou wasted time on one volunteer campaign after another...\nI hope this will serve as a good wake up call.\d%K%P
「留学中的报告我看了。\n想当个没用的志愿者，你也太天真了。\n脑子清醒了点儿吗？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dI will contact you in due time. By then... make sure to\nsettle everything you've gotten yourself into in order to\nleave with a clear head. That applies to your relationship\nwith that man.\d%K%P
「近期我还会联系你的。\n在那之前，你先清理一下门户。\n………包括在你身边的那个男人」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCJunpei
%LC顺平
\dYou fool...\d%K%P
「笨丫头啊…」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAh...\d%K%P
「啊…」%K%P
He did not even give us time for retaliation. Well, not\nlike his forcefulness allowed room for any.%K%P
直到最后，连反抗都不被容许…\n或者说，连反抗的力量都被夺走了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dAh, ah...\d%K%P
「啊、啊…」%K%P
Himeo staggered a few steps and -- seemingly robbed of all\nher strength -- leaned against me as the phone slipped\nfrom her fingers.%K%P
我搀扶着姬绪小姐，\n她仿佛失去了全身的力气一般，\n手机从手中滑落。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHimeo...\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐…」%K%P
Even in my arms, she kept twisting her body protectively,\nnever giving me an opportunity to fully embrace her.%K%P
我紧紧地抱着她，\n但她却在我的怀中扭动，\n不想让身体靠着我。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dDad...\d%K%P
「爸爸他…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dHuh?\d%K%P
「诶？」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dMy father was bullying Toko...\nMy family was making her life even harder than it already\nwas...\d%K%P
「我的爸爸，欺负了小都子…\n泽嶋家，居然那样对待她…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...But it has nothing to do with you personally.\d%K%P
「…这和你没有关系」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dI promised to protect her... I said I would not let\nanyone lay a hand on her. But look at this. How much more\nridiculous can I be?\d%K%P
「要保护小都子…\n不想让别人动她一根手指…\n这是谁家人说过的啊…简直太可笑了吧？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou're not being ridiculous... Himeo.\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐…这并不可笑的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWhat's wrong with me...? First I took the person that\nmeant the most to her... and now I'm taking away her\nhome...\d%K%P
「我…算什么啊？\n从小都子那里，抢走了心爱的人，\n这次又抢走了她充满回忆的的居所…」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dNeither of those things are your fault, Himeo.\d%K%P
「姫绪小姐…并没有错」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dThis really is the end... Toko will never forgive me now.\nI... I... Things will never be the same after this,\never...!!\d%K%P
「果然，已经完蛋了…\n小都子，已经不会原谅我了。\n我、我…再也补偿不了她了…啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere are very few things in this world that truly cannot\nbe fixed. It's okay. We still have a fighting chance.\d%K%P
「这个世界上，补偿不了另一个人这种事，\n遍地都是吧。\n没关系，我们还能再战的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dOsamu... Osamu, Osamu, Osamu...!!\d%K%P
「理先生…呜，\n理先生理先生理先生…啊」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dThere, there. It's okay. I really can't take my eyes off\nyou, now can I...\d%K%P
「好了好了…\n真是离不开人照顾啊，你」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dW-Waah... Aaah... Waaaaaah...\d%K%P
「呜、呜呜…呜呜呜…呜呜呜呜呜～…」%K%P
Himeo's indignant sobs, directed both at her family and\nherself, melted into my breast.%K%P
姫绪小姐，对自己的家…\n对自己自责的呜咽声，敲打着我的内心。%K%P
All the same, I wasn't thinking of this as a defeat.%K%P
不过我，却不认为我们就此败北了。%K%P
She would rise again, and our real fight would begin. All\nI had to do now was help her stand up.%K%P
我要治愈她受伤的心灵，\n然后再度站起来，\n因为我们的斗争才刚刚开始。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWaaaaah... Aaaaaaaah!!\d%K%P
「呜呜呜呜呜…呜、呜呜呜呜呜呜」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dYou can sleep once you feel tired. I'm not going\nanywhere. I'll stay with you until morning.\d%K%P
「累了就睡下吧。\n今晚，我一直会在你身边的」%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dWaaaaaaaah, aaaaaaaaaaah...!!\d%K%P
「呜呜呜呜呜呜呜，\n呜啊、啊啊啊啊啊啊啊…啊」%K%P
Mr. Sawashima Junpei...%K%P
泽嶋顺平先生…%K%P
The father of my boss and the top member of our real\nestate food chain -- a tyrant of unparalleled influence\nand power lording over us from above the clouds.%K%P
作为我上司的父亲，\n也就是上司的上司的上司。\n那是君临天之王座的，伟大的暴君。%K%P
But... I would make him reap what he sowed.%K%P
可是我，决不会原谅他。%K%P
He would pay for making Himeo cry, and for hurting Mitoko\n-- the two most important people to me in the world.%K%P
伤害了姫绪小姐和美都子…\n让我最心爱的两个人难过流泪，我怎么能原谅这个老贼。%K%P
I didn't know whether I could win this gamble... In fact,\nrational thinking would tell me that the possibility of my\nvictory was excruciatingly low, but...%K%P
该怎么反败为胜，我的心里还没有数…\n不，从常识的角度考虑，反败为胜的概率几近于零。%K%P
...that was nothing new for me. I would just do what I\nalways did -- pour all my efforts into not losing.%K%P
可是，我已经身经百战了。\n只是因为不想输，所以要尽最大可能地努力。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dSo please... Stop crying.\d%K%P
「所以…不要哭了」%K%P
She was the sole trump card I knew of that could possibly\nlead to Sawashima Junpei's defeat.%K%P
因为，你是我所知的，\n能够对付泽嶋顺平的，唯一的王牌了。%K%P
%LCHimeo
%LC姫绪
\dSniff, sniff, hahh... uahh... bshhhhh!\d%K%P
「呜、呜、呜…呜呜…啊、\n呜呜呜呜呜呜～啊！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...Though, I'd appreciate if you didn't use my shirt as a\ntissue.\d%K%P
「…为什么你总是，\n把我的衬衫当做纸巾来用啊」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou really want to give up?\d%K%P
「真的，要放弃吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Yeah.\d%K%P
「…嗯」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI would have agreed if this was before the summer break,\nbut now... it feels like a lot of wasted potential.\d%K%P
「要是在暑假之前的话，我还是会赞成的，\n但是如今…有点儿可惜了啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYour grades are as good as they have ever been, and with\nthose, getting a scholarship at Shuusen Preparatory is no\npipe dream. I'm not saying it would be easy, but...\d%K%P
「一学期下来，成绩几乎完全恢复了以前的水平，\n入选秋泉大附的免费生，也不是没有可能。\n…嘛，那也不是轻而易举就是了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dIt's okay... I don't want it anymore...\d%K%P
「够了…这样就好」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dReally?\d%K%P
「真的吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...Yeah. ...Yes.\d%K%P
「………嗯…是的」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAll right. Let's not think about Shuusen for now. ...In\nthat case, what kind of school would you want to attend?\d%K%P
「我明白了。\n那关于秋泉大附的话题，先就此不提。\n…那，你的目标是哪里呢？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI hope you're not implying that... you're planning the\nsame thing as in May?\d%K%P
「难道说…\n回到了五月那个时候的状态了吗？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI...\d%K%P
「那个…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻実
\dThat's one thing I'm not letting you do... Do you know\nhow much effort all the adults around you put into\navoiding that scenario?\d%K%P
「那可是不行的啊…\n身边的大人们都拼命地使出全力，\n为了实现你的梦想而奋斗着…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dBut... I don't even have a home anymore...\d%K%P
「可是…我家已经…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dNo one has given up yet. Not Osamu, nor your friend next\ndoor, and certainly not me. The only exception... is you.\d%K%P
「谁还都没有放弃啊。\n理也好，邻家的大小姐也好，我当然也没有放弃。\n…对，只有你一个人放弃了」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...\d%K%P
「………」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dThis is admittedly a tough situation. One that you cannot\ndeal with by yourself. I do think God is unfair, and I\nhate him for it. But...\d%K%P
「事情的确很不妙。\n对于美都子来说，简直太残酷了。\n老天爷真的是很不公平。不过啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dMs. Kouno...?\d%K%P
「老师…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dStill... if you really do love studying, you shouldn't\ngive up on it because of something like this.\d%K%P
「不过，如果你真的想要继续学习的话，\n我觉得你不应该因为这种程度的事就放弃」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dSomething like this...? Something like this...?! Listen\nhere!\d%K%P
「这种程度？\n这种程度什么的…我说啊！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI mean, you're sulking because of something completely\nunrelated to all of this.\d%K%P
「因为美都子会闹别扭，\n和这次的事件完全无关吧」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dS-Sulking?!\d%K%P
「闹、闹别扭！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI imagine you must be upset by how distant you've become\nfrom those two, and regret the things you've said. You're\nfurious because he was taken from you, but...\d%K%P
「被朋友排除在外了，感到生疏感了，\n多管闲事了，明明先到却被超过了，\n你大概是那么想的吧…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAAAAAAAH?!\d%K%P
「啊啊啊啊啊啊！？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dFrom my perspective, it was this childish stubbornness of\nyours that ultimately brought those two together.\d%K%P
「要让我说，\n正因为你这样像个孩子似的意气用事，\n所以反而让他们两人走到了一起吧？」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou better watch what you say to me! You don't even know\nanything about me, or how I feel!\d%K%P
「不要随便乱说啊！\n你明明对我的想法什么都不了解的！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dYou're right... I didn't. I mostly thought of you as a\nsomewhat stubborn but overall diligent honor student in my\nclass.\d%K%P
「是啊…我什么都不了解。\n虽然有些顽固，可你还是个认真的模范优等生啊」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dHuh...?\d%K%P
「诶…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\d...I never suspected you to be the kind of -girl- who\ncompletely loses her head over these matters.\d%K%P
「…如此固执己见，\n我没想到，你是这样一个容易沉溺其中的『笨笨的女孩子』」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dAh, ahh, aaaahhh!!\d%K%P
「啊、啊～、啊啊啊啊啊～！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI wonder why Osamu always ends up attracting girls like\nthat.\d%K%P
「…为什么理的身边，\n聚集的净是这样的女孩子呢」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dN-No! L-Look, you're wrong about this, okay?!\nMe and Osamu... It wasn't like that at all! No!\d%K%P
「不、不对，不对啊！\n我对、理君、才没有、才没有！」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's okay. You're not alone.\d%K%P
「没关系的，你不是一个人在战斗」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dE...Eh...?\d%K%P
「诶、诶…？」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dHer name was Kaya, right? She's just as hopeless as you\nare. ...And I know of at least one more.\d%K%P
「夏夜小姐呢？\n她也是笨到一定程度的人呢。\n而且…我想还有一个人也是」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dYou mean...\d%K%P
「那是…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dSo do try to keep your chin up, even if that's not how\nyou feel on the inside. You're not alone; there are--\d%K%P
「所以，就算虚张声势也好，打起精神吧。\n你决不是一个人在…」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dI don't want to be part of a group of losers like\nthat...\d%K%P
「就算是这样，我也不想加入她们之中，真丢人…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI see you still haven't completely lost your spirit.\d%K%P
「你怎么还是那么嘴硬啊…」%K%P
...%K%P
………%K%P
